{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"他问怎样生活，累得没答案，眼下也不踏实\",\"source\":\"如果把这次回返听成心理上的回望，开头的试探姿态仿佛把问题重新递回来：“那么，我究竟要怎样继续生活？”\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"严重\",\"why\":\"定稿把“怎样继续生活”作为一种可能的听觉联想，屏幕稿却写成他确实在问这个问题，把珠子里的想象变成了人物确定的内心活动。\"},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"screen\":\"他知道自己【还会犹疑】、疲惫、想念\",\"source\":\"这份挺立也可以听成经历动摇后的主动选择：即使知道自己会犹疑、疲惫、想念，仍然可以决定怎样站立。\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将这层心理解释限定为一种可选的听法，屏幕稿却直接断定他知道自己还会如此，把可能的解读变成了确定的内心认知。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d910e2ac-a26e-4cfa-a495-65fb8e5cb909", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T165502839513Z", "elapsed_seconds": 385.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T17:01:28.729024+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e19481eba843664792f67cb9e4db123f2e9c77b965a17283c58d451ee68c517f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa